(7337521, 1145879, 81362, '<td valign="top">The boat makes a pleasing diagonal and holds interest with nice play of light and that interesting roof. To my eye, the thickness of the black border makes it seem like a separate competing subject itself instead of a subtle enhancement for the actual subject.</td>', 'The boat makes a pleasing diagonal and holds interest with nice play of light and that interesting roof. To my eye, the thickness of the black border makes it seem like a separate competing subject itself instead of a subtle enhancement for the actual subject.', '2015-04-04 08:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7337523, 1145251, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of smooth wet suit against highly textured rough foam. Because my eyes expect parts of the foam to be brilliant white, the extensive color cast (leaving none of the foam pure white) ends up leaving an undesired uncomfortable feeling that takes away from the image.</td>', 'Nice contrast of smooth wet suit against highly textured rough foam. Because my eyes expect parts of the foam to be brilliant white, the extensive color cast (leaving none of the foam pure white) ends up leaving an undesired uncomfortable feeling that takes away from the image.', '2015-04-04 08:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7337524, 1145580, 81362, '<td valign="top">The lower right quarter of this image is absolutely lovely. Really like the back light blow on the dog and the composition of path, hill, detailed branches and leaves with more distant environment providing depth. In the left upper quarter, the distant city skyline and shipping cranes framed by the dark tree line closer to us makes another promising image. I''d enjoy seeing these as separate images.</td>', 'The lower right quarter of this image is absolutely lovely. Really like the back light blow on the dog and the composition of path, hill, detailed branches and leaves with more distant environment providing depth. In the left upper quarter, the distant city skyline and shipping cranes framed by the dark tree line closer to us makes another promising image. I''d enjoy seeing these as separate images.', '2015-04-04 08:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7337525, 1145346, 81362, '<td valign="top">Really nice detail. Rare to see hummingbird preening captured.</td>', 'Really nice detail. Rare to see hummingbird preening captured.', '2015-04-04 08:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
